{title: Hum Jo Chalne Lage}
{artist: Shaan Pritam}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Hum jo chalne la [Eb]ge,        chalne la [Gm]ge hai ye raas [Dm]te
Aa han [Gm]haan Manzil se,        [Eb]behtar lagne la [Gm]ge
hai ye raas [Dm]te,        Aaao [Gm]kho jaye [F]hum
ho jaye [Eb]hum yu lapa [Cm]ta,        Aao [Gm]milo chale [Dm]
jana kah [Eb]an na ho pa [Cm]ta,        [Gm]Hum jo chalne la [Eb]ge,
chalne la [Gm]ge hai ye raas [Dm]te,        Aa han [Gm]haan...
[Gm]Baithe baithe aise,        [Bb]kaise koi [Eb]rasta naya se mi [Dm]le
[Gm]Tu bhi chale main [Bb]bhi chalu,        [Gm]Baithe baithe aise [Bb]kaise koi
[Eb]rasta naya se mi [Dm]le,        [Gm]Tu bhi chale main [Bb]bhi chalu
honge [Eb]kam ye kabhi faas [Dm]le,        Aao [Gm]tera me [F]ra
na ho kisi [Eb]se vas [Cm]ta,        Aaaoo [Gm]milo chale
[Dm]jana kahan [Eb]na ho pata [Cm]
